<!DOCTYPE qhelp PUBLIC
  "-//Semmle//qhelp//EN"
  "qhelp.dtd">
<qhelp>
<overview>
<p>
Bare (unquoted) URI literals such as <code>https://example.com</code> are
deprecated by Nix RFC 45 and are scheduled for removal from the language.
Using a quoted string keeps the code compatible with current and future Nix
versions.
</p>
</overview>

<recommendation>
<p>
Wrap URI values in quotes so they are parsed as ordinary string literals, for
example <code>"https://example.com"</code>.
</p>
</recommendation>

<example>
<p>Deprecated — bare URI literals:</p>
<sample language="nix">
let
  src = https://example.com/foo.tar.gz;
  url = ftp://example.com/foo;
in
  { inherit src url; }
</sample>
<p>Recommended — quoted strings:</p>
<sample language="nix">
let
  src = "https://example.com/foo.tar.gz";
  url = "ftp://example.com/foo";
in
  { inherit src url; }
</sample>
</example>

<references>
<li>
Nix RFC 45:
<a href="https://github.com/NixOS/rfcs/blob/master/rfcs/0045-deprecate-url-syntax.md">
Deprecate URL syntax</a>
</li>
<li>
CWE: <a href="https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/477.html">CWE-477:
Use of Obsolete Function</a>
</li>
</references>
</qhelp>
